OL,3,AThree children injured after school bus
OL,4,Aroof ripped off in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree children have been injured when a
OL,7,Fschool bus crashed into a railway
OL,8,Fbridge, police have said.
OL,10,FGwent Police said it received a report
OL,11,Fof a crash in Tregare Street, Newport,
OL,12,Fat about 07:45 BST on Tuesday.
OL,14,FThe bus was travelling to Ysgol Gyfun
OL,15,FGwent Is Coed, a Welshb@Qmedium
OL,16,Fsecondary school on Duffryn Way,
OL,17,FNewport.
OL,19,FThe pupils' injuries are not thought to
OL,20,Fbe life-threatening, the force said,
OL,21,Fbut the children have been taken to
OL,22,Fhospital for treatment.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
